2 CONT # Gurina, f. 9/2 1856, d. 9/3 1856.
2 CONT # Gurina, f. 17/4 1857, Tjora, bruk 10, huslyd 1.
2 CONT # Sven Laurits, f. 27/7 1860, d. 26/4 1867.
