1 NAME Kirstine Ellingsdatter /Horpestad/
2 GIVN Kirstine Ellingsdatter
2 SURN Horpestad
2 _MARNM Horpestad
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 DEC 1811
2 PLAC Nedre Horpestad, Klepp, Rogaland
